### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/products

###

### Get all products filtered by name
GET http://localhost:3000/products?name=keyboard

###

### Get all products sorted by price (ascending)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=price

###

### Get all products sorted by price (descending)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=-price

###

### Get a single product by id
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

###

### Get a product that doesn't exist (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/9999

###

### Add a new product
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Headphones",
  "price": 3500,
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### Add a product with missing name (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 100,
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Update a product (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard Pro",
  "price": 3500,
  "quantity": 4
}

###

### Update a product that doesn't exist (should return 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Product",
  "price": 0,
  "quantity": 0
}

###

### Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/3

###

### Delete a product that doesn't exist (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/9999
